  "shotWords": [
    "When a horsefly",
    "bites you,",
    "it presses",
    "six",
    "needle",
    "",
    "-like",
    "tools",
    "against your skin. Two of them have sharp edges, so they slice",
    "you open like",
    "scissors,",
    "while two more have tiny teeth like a saw, sawing up and down to tear",
    "open your blood vessels until they burst and you start to",
    "bleed. Next, a hollow blade pumps in spit,",
    "which stops the cut from sealing so the blood keeps flowing out",
    "as its spongy tip",
    "laps it",
    "up."
  ],
